    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to hide in plain sight or hunt down the hidden? <strong>PROPTOP\u00a0</strong>is an intense multiplayer hide-and-seek game where players transform into everyday objects to evade hunters or track down disguised props!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Key Features:</strong><br>\u2705 <strong>Thrilling Hide &amp; Seek Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Disguise yourself as a prop or take on the role of a hunter in fast-paced, strategic matches.<br>\u2705 <strong>Dynamic Maps</strong> \u2013 Explore a variety of unique environments designed for maximum hiding and hunting fun.<br>\u2705 <strong>Deceptive Disguises</strong> \u2013 Blend in with your surroundings by mimicking objects and outsmarting your pursuers.<br>\u2705 <strong>Exciting Abilities &amp; Power-Ups</strong> \u2013 Use special skills to escape, mislead, or track down opponents.<br>\u2705 <strong>Multiplayer Madness</strong> \u2013 Play with friends or challenge players worldwide in action-packed matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be the ultimate hider, the relentless hunter, or the mastermind who outplays them all? Join the game now and test your skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2b <strong>Hunt. Hide. Survive.</strong> \ud83c\udfad</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to hide in plain sight or hunt down the hidden? <strong>PROPTOP\u00a0</strong>is an intense multiplayer hide-and-seek game where players transform into everyday objects to evade hunters or track down disguised props!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Key Features:</strong><br>\u2705 <strong>Thrilling Hide &amp; Seek Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Disguise yourself as a prop or take on the role of a hunter in fast-paced, strategic matches.<br>\u2705 <strong>Dynamic Maps</strong> \u2013 Explore a variety of unique environments designed for maximum hiding and hunting fun.<br>\u2705 <strong>Deceptive Disguises</strong> \u2013 Blend in with your surroundings by mimicking objects and outsmarting your pursuers.<br>\u2705 <strong>Exciting Abilities &amp; Power-Ups</strong> \u2013 Use special skills to escape, mislead, or track down opponents.<br>\u2705 <strong>Multiplayer Madness</strong> \u2013 Play with friends or challenge players worldwide in action-packed matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be the ultimate hider, the relentless hunter, or the mastermind who outplays them all? Join the game now and test your skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2b <strong>Hunt. Hide. Survive.</strong> \ud83c\udfad</p>",
